 "poem": "Howe'er the love resists,\nThe spirit of Love remain,\nIt shall be always seen again,\nAs ever its Spirit again,\nThis my Light-hearted Heart intends\nTo walk through time separated,\nThrough winds which are drifting now again\nAbout me where I was later,\nWhile still God and Heaven confirm me\nIn this high goal's realization. Translation\nFrom the original Greek published\nBy the Litt'l Society, won",
